  "goodToKnow": "Nachlesen means to look something up or read up on it: Das kannst du in der Anleitung nachlesen. Nachzulesen bei... means as can be read in... It's similar to nachschlagen (to look up in a reference book) and recherchieren (to research). Die Nachlese is a review or follow-up of an event; originally, it meant gleaning, picking up what was left after the harvest. Separable and irregular: liest nach, las nach, nachgelesen."
